        '## And Batman, in between',
        'All of this he has juggled with “The Batman: Part II”, which started shooting on 12 June at Warner Bros. Studios Leavesden, with exteriors in London, Liverpool and Glasgow, and with Sebastian Stan and Scarlett Johansson as Harvey and Gilda Dent, Charles Dance as his father and the return of Jeffrey Wright, Andy Serkis and Colin Farrell. Warner has dated it for 18 February 2028, four years after the first. In other words: while releasing four films, he was shooting the fifth, and the fifth is the one paying for the other four.',
